  "story": {
    "day": 113,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Morning",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya woke up in her bedroom, not feeling lonely.",
      "She loved the quiet world around her.",
      "The day before yesterday, she felt sick with a headache.",
      "She went to the bathroom then for a warm bath.",
      "She brushed her teeth carefully; her tooth felt clean.",
      "In the dining room, she had a snack of cold barley tea.",
      "She put her homework away after a small battle.",
      "Kaya checked her tablet online for a sale on jeans and a shirt.",
      "She was sure she can buy them.",
      "She had forty minutes to give water to her plant in the corner.",
      "She wanted to write a message for the fourth circus volunteer.",
      "\"Yeah!\" she called, ready to sit. She heard laughter and began to sing, thinking of a witch on page ninetieth; she picked up some litter."
    ]
  }
}